      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Due to their filthy eating habits and constant exposure to decaying flesh, zuus are harbingers of disease. Any creature bitten by a zuu has a 10% chance of being exposed to filth fever, blinding sickness, or a similar disease. Once this check is made, a victim can no longer be infected by this particular zuu, though attacks by different zuus are resolved normally and may result in multiple illnesses. While zuu aren't immune to all disease, they do gain a +4 racial bonus on all saving throws against such ailments.</p>",
